#: ../../templates.rst:192
msgid ""
"Guidedog's embedded built-in templates (``layout.html``, ``page.html``, "
"``article.html``, ``collection.html``, ``landing.html``, ``search.html``, "
"``genindex.html``, ``modindex.html``)."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog "
"内嵌的内置模板（``layout.html``、``page.html``、``article.html``、``collection.html``、``landing.html``、``search.html``、``genindex.html``、``modindex.html``）。"

#: ../../templates.rst:194
msgid ""
"Template names are relative to the template directories. They cannot "
"escape those directories with parent directory traversal (``..``)."
msgstr "模板名称相对于各模板目录，不能通过上级目录引用（``..``）跳出这些目录。"

#: ../../templates.rst:196
msgid ""
"During rendering, the Jinja environment records the content digest of "
"every template, parent layout, included partial, and imported macro file "
"that each page loads. When a template or partial file is edited, "
"``guidedog build`` and ``guidedog serve`` rebuild only the pages whose "
"template chain loaded that file. Editing ``article.html`` rebuilds "
"articles without rebuilding documentation chapters that render "
"``layout.html`` directly; editing ``layout.html`` rebuilds every page "
"that extends it."
msgstr ""
"在渲染过程中，Jinja "
"环境会记录每个页面加载的所有模板、父布局、包含的局部模板以及导入的宏文件的内容摘要。当修改某个模板或局部模板文件时，``guidedog "
"build`` 和 ``guidedog serve`` 只会重新构建模板链中加载了该文件的页面。修改 ``article.html`` "
"只会重新构建文章页，而不会重新构建直接渲染 ``layout.html`` 的文档章节；修改 ``layout.html`` "
"则会重新构建所有继承它的页面。"

